ARCHIVE INTERPRETATION
READ and EXPORT events establish observation, not authorship. APPROVE establishes workflow authority, not execution. MODIFY/REVERT/SCHEDULE events must be matched against the state that existed when the incident began.

IDENTITY WARNING
A valid user ID can appear on a session originating from an unregistered console. Treat account ownership and physical/session authorship as separate questions.
